  "narrative": {
    "text": "**Business & market dynamics:** Claritev enters 2026 with steady commercial momentum, as top-line growth was broad-based across both core and expansion areas. The company’s positioning as a technology, data, and insights platform aimed at healthcare affordability continues to resonate, reflected in healthy contract bookings. Demand appears durable and supported by a business model that generates high incremental profitability, though the macro and regulatory backdrop is not flagged as a notable headwind or tailwind in the recent period’s commentary.\n\n**Management strategy and execution:** Leadership struck a confident tone, citing outperformance and focused operational execution. The team raised the full-year sales floor shortly after its Investor Day, where it detailed a multi-year “Vision 2030” roadmap centered on matching horizontal product capabilities with a broader set of end-market verticals. While a GAAP net loss persists, the narrative around execution credibility is being bolstered by significant cash flow generation improvement and the decision to reinvest with an eye toward long-term durability.",
